   "text": "chunk merge \u00b7 runs when marker H is decoded \u00b7 key touched by xid \u2265 chunk xmin:\ncomplete image in the stream \u2192 drop \u00b7 only a patch \u2192 read the row again\nappend the rest as op \"read\" \u00b7 batch ack LSN = H",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
