   "text": "Tx ledger \u00b7 delivered LSN moves only across contiguous done batches\nack = end LSN of the last whole transaction \u00b7 fragments carry none\nmarker H is acked like a commit \u00b7 reported LSN = delivered, capped by a hold",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Tx ledger \u00b7 delivered LSN moves only across contiguous done batches\nack = end LSN of the last whole transaction \u00b7 fragments carry none\nmarker H is acked like a commit \u00b7 reported LSN = delivered, capped by a hold",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
